266
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:05,207
And I'm going to get to printing
a tree through in-order,

267
00:11:05,207 --> 00:11:06,290
pre-order, and post-order.

268
00:11:06,290 --> 00:11:08,690
In fact, I'll end on
