275
00:11:28,940 --> 00:11:30,400
go to the right
through recursive calls

276
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,192
until you found it.

277
00:11:31,192 --> 00:11:32,145
So the base case is--

278
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:41,650
the base case is,
if my key matches--

279
00:11:41,650 --> 00:11:43,650
excuse me, if my search
key matches my root key,

