00:15:04,150 --> 00:15:06,910
you're looking for of
all the nodes in my tree.

362
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:09,530
But you need to go through
everything in the tree.

363
00:15:09,530 --> 00:15:12,700
So the tree traversals I'm
going to talk about next refer

364
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:15,340
to traversing the entire tree.

